  "description": "<h2>ENGWE M20 Features</h2>\n<p>1. Powerful motor</p>\n<p>2. 150km long range (48V 26Ah dual battery version)</p>\n<p>3. Dual suspension &amp; 20-inch fat tires</p>\n<p>4. Fast speed</p>\n<p>5. Shimano 7-speed transmission</p>\n<p>6. 160mm front &amp; rear disc machine brake</p>\n<h2>What About ENGWE M20?</h2>\n<p>The ENGWE M20 is an impressive electric fat bike that boasts a striking design reminiscent of a motorcycle. Its streamlined structure not only enhances its futuristic look but also improves aerodynamics for a smoother ride. Equipped with a powerful motor, the M20 delivers exceptional performance, offering a long-range dual batteries that allows for up to 150 km of travel on a single charge. The full suspension system ensures a comfortable and stable ride over rough terrain, while the 20-inch fat tires provide superior traction and control, making it perfect for various off-road conditions.</p>\n<p>In a word, as a full suspension mountain bike, ENGWE M20 allows you to ride smoothly and enjoy the thrill of the ride. Whether you're a daily rider or a weekend adventurer, this fat tyre electric bike is sure to surprise you!</p>\n<h2>ENGWE M20 Fat E-Bike Spec</h2>\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\" border=\"2\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.9565%;\">Motor</td>\n<td style=\"width: 51.7568%;\">250W Brushless Motor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.9565%;\">Speed</td>\n<td style=\"width: 51.7568%;\">25 km/h</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.9565%;\">Material</td>\n<td style=\"width: 51.7568%;\">6061 Aluminum Alloy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.9565%;\">Torque</td>\n<td style=\"width: 51.7568%;\">55 N.m</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.9565%;\">Tires</td>\n<td style=\"width: 51.7568%;\">20 x 4.0 Fat Tires</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.9565%;\">13Ah Battery Version</td>\n<td style=\"width: 51.7568%;\">48V13Ah Lithium-Ion Battery *1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.9565%;\">26Ah Batteries Version</td>\n<td style=\"width: 51.7568%;\">48V 13Ah Lithium-Ion Battery *2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.9565%;\">Max Mileage</td>\n<td style=\"width: 51.7568%;\">75KM at PAS mode 1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.9565%;\">Charging Time</td>\n<td style=\"width: 51.7568%;\">About 5H</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.9565%;\">Maximum Climbing degree</td>\n<td style=\"width: 51.7568%;\">10\u00b0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.9565%;\">Brake</td>\n<td style=\"width: 51.7568%;\">180mm Front &amp; Rear Disc Machine Brake</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.9565%;\">Transmission System</td>\n<td style=\"width: 51.7568%;\">Shimano 7 Gears</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.9565%;\">Display</td>\n<td style=\"width: 51.7568%;\">LCD Display</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.9565%;\">Bike Weight</td>\n<td style=\"width: 51.7568%;\">76.72lbs (34.8KG)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.9565%;\">13Ah Battery Version Gross Weight</td>\n<td style=\"width: 51.7568%;\">94.13lbs (42.7KG)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.9565%;\">26Ah Battery Version Gross Weight</td>\n<td style=\"width: 51.7568%;\">104.05lbs (45.9KG)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
